# The Cyberdyne design system is published to GitHub Packages. The registry is
# declared here so that adding @cyberdynecorp/svelte-ui-core (task 1.2) is one
# dependency line rather than a machine setup step; the credential is never
# committed — it comes from the environment as NODE_AUTH_TOKEN / a personal
# ~/.npmrc line.
@cyberdynecorp:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
